<hr WIDTH="100%"></center>

<p><font color="#0000FF"><font size="+2">N</font></font> means that the map is a normal map.
<br><font color="#FF0000"><font size="+2">T</font></font> means that the map is a teamplaymap.
<br><font color="#00FF00"><font size="+2">R</font></font> means that the map is a racingmap.
<FORM ACTION="xpilotmaps.shtml" METHOD="get">
<TABLE BORDER=0><TR><TD>
Show 
<SELECT NAME="type">
 <OPTION VALUE="all">all
 <OPTION VALUE="normal">normal
 <OPTION VALUE="timing">race
 <OPTION VALUE="teamplay">team
</SELECT>
 maps &nbsp; &nbsp;<INPUT TYPE="submit" VALUE="Go!">
</TD></TR></TABLE>
</FORM>
