</tr>

<tr>
<td COLSPAN="2"><img SRC="/Xpilot/Maps/spider.gif" ALT="Spider Web" HSPACE=5 height=99 width=99 align=LEFT>
This map is somewhat like LARDBOTTOM's Vat of Lard. &nbsp;The person in the center is the spider, and the other four teams are the flies. &nbsp;The flies have to go into the spider's parlor, grab the treasure, and take it back to their nest without getting stuck in the web.<BR>
</td>
