<P>You can upload you own maps here too by using the form below.
<BR>The maximum filesize is 100 Kb, which is more than enough for maps.
<BR>When you click on the "Browse..."-button, a dialog will appear where you
can select your map. Note that the dialog will start looking for HTML-files, 
which is wrong. You can correct this by letting is search for *.* instead of *.html.
<FORM ENCTYPE="multipart/form-data" ACTION="/cgi-bin/mapupload.cgi" METHOD="POST">
<CENTER><TABLE><TR><TD>
<CENTER><INPUT TYPE="FILE" SIZE=40 NAME=mapfile></CENTER>
</TD></TR><TR><TD><CENTER>
<P><INPUT TYPE="SUBMIT" VALUE="Submit">&nbsp;
<INPUT TYPE="RESET" VALUE="Reset"></CENTER></TD></TABLE>
</CENTER></FORM>
<HR WIDTH="100%"><P>
<A HREF="xpilotmaps.delete.shtml">Click here</A>, if you wish to delete one of your maps. I am still working
on a more fancy way to edit a map. Now you just have to delete your map and upload the
new version.
